            "review_title": "Review at Nha Tien",
            "review_text": "fromwesthaus\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam50 contributions\n1\nMy local hangout\nAug 2019 • Business\nI wish more people knew about this place, it’s a little hidden gem in a cul-de-sac area in Thao Dien. Brilliant service, excellent food and wonderful ambience. Also dog-friendly which makes them Uber lovely!\nWritten August 10, 2019\nNha Tien\nHi Fromwesthaus,\n\n\bThank you so much for the kind words. Your positive feedback makes our day. \n\nAs a family business, we do our best to present our guests with homie services and dishes made freshly per order. We are so happy that you had a great time with us. We look forward to welcoming you back soon! \n\nMs. Tiên, Ellie & Team Nha Tien\nRead more\nWritten August 13, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
